    "detailed_description": "<strong>A Basketball Battle for the Ages! Think fast and use stylish moves to dunk on the competition!</strong><br><br>Take on your friends in the freshest 3 on 3 College Basketball League!<br>Elite Players battle it out equipped with the hottest skills the world's ever seen!<br>Shoot with precision from Downtown, or take it to the paint to unleash a Showstopping Dunk!<br>The defense in this Town is no joke, but a well timed &quot;Street Step&quot; can unleash the full power of your Offense!<br><br><strong>Features</strong><br>-Fast paced and frantic head to head action! Ball against your friends on the couch or against an array of challenging CPUs!<br>-Eight unique teams with their own strengths and weaknesses, along with eight alternate Loadouts with their own unique properties!<br>-A challenging arcade-style gauntlet, with eight unique routes! Rep your favorite team, take on the best in the country, and soar to the top of that Bracket!<br><br><strong>Notes</strong><br>Platform supported: Windows 7+<br>Input supported: Xinput (Xbox One/Series Controller recommended), Keyboard",
